    },{"text_field":"Anthem emailed me to have me sign up for this to 'assess' my 'COVID-19 symptoms'. First attempt at registering, it hangs at password entry. Tried a dozen times, gave up, and tried several hours later. Now I just never even receive a 1-time code to progress far enough to enter a password. Maybe do not push your app on people until you get the infrastructure in place to support the surge?"}
